This is a simple test of whether the thickness constraint works on the reservoir layer.

# Generate models nconditional to thickness constraint:
delivery ModelDescription.xml -m prior_traces.su -v 3 -PD -N 200 -IS -II
# View thickness histogram
deliveryAnalyser -i realisations.su --histogram thickness 2 | graph -TX

# Generate models conditioned to thickness constraint:
delivery ModelDescription.xml -m prior_traces.su -v 3 -PD -N 200 -IS -RWS
# View thickness histogram
deliveryAnalyser -i realisations.su --histogram thickness 2 | graph -TX

